["Mhla ilanga lifiphala;","Nezinkanyezi ziqathake;","Izintaba zinyomulwa;","Amakameli amithi anganakwa;","Izilwane zasendle zibuthaniswa;","Ulwandle lokhelwa;","Imiphefumulo [abantu] iyobuthaniswa ngononina;","Nentombazane eyangcwatshwa iphila ibuzwa [ukuthi],","Wabulawela liphi icala;","Imiqulu isatshalaliswa;","Isibhakabhaka sisuswa;","Isihogo sivuthiswa ubuhanguhangu;","IJana isondezwa,","Wonke umuntu uyokwazi akwenzile.","Akengifunge ngezinkanyezi ezifiphalayo,","Ezigijimayo ezishanelayo.","Nangobusuku uma memboza,","Nangokusa uma buqhakaza;","Nebala [iKurani] ingamazwi eSithunywa eSihloniphekile [uJibhirili].","Esinamandla, esisezingeni eliphezulu kuMnini weSihlalo [u Allah].","Siyahlonishwa belu sithembekile.","Umuntu wenu [uMuhamadi] akahlanyi,","Bheka ngoba wasibona [iSithunywa uJibhirili] okwalweni olubanzi.","Futhi akafihli lutho kokungabonwa.","Futhi akusiwona amazwi kaShayitani oqalekisiwe.","Ngakhoke niyaphi na?","Bheka ngoba iyiSikhumbuzo nje ezizweni zonke.","Kulowo kini olangezelela ukuba qotho.","Futhi angeke nafisa ngaphandle kwentando ka Allah iNkosi yezizwe zonke."]